WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:08.493
Wosamalira wagwira khandalo lili choimirira.

00:00:08.493 --> 00:00:16.987
Woyezayo akuyang'ana kayendedwe ka khanda, kulimba kwa minofu, mmene lakhalira, ndi mmene likuyang'anira chinthu.

00:00:16.987 --> 00:00:25.480
Pa sikirini pali malangizo oti ayang'ane maso, ngati ali molunjika, kuwala kofiira kobwerera ndi mwana wa diso woyera.
